Vortek client (brunodev85/vortek b1730c5): leaks and a missing pointer, applied by tools/build-runtime.py.

- vkMapMemory on memory that is already mapped returned VK_SUCCESS without setting *ppData.
- vkFreeMemory freed the mapping record but left the mapping itself (munmap; a placed mapping belongs to the caller).
- vkFreeCommandBuffers never freed the command buffers' objects; VkObjectPool freed its objects with free() instead
  of VkObject_free().

